igai ja nai to shinjiteComment: 0,0:19:47.37,0:19:55.92,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Araku uneru unabara wo watatte yukeruComment: 0,0:19:56.43,0:20:05.63,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Dare yori mo yuukan de omoiyari mo aru keredoComment: 0,0:20:05.94,0:20:16.00,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Moshimo kimi ga kono fune wo orite chigau sekai ni ita toshite moComment: 0,0:20:16.06,0:20:24.43,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Saigo ni wa kitto waraeru yoComment: 0,0:19:37.90,0:19:47.33,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,あの日|ひ夢|!ゆ#|め見|!みた僕|ぼ#|くらは 間|!ま違|!ち#|がいじゃないと信|し#|んじてComment: 0,0:19:47.37,0:19:55.92,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,荒|あ#|らくうねる海|う#|な原|!ば#|らを渡|わ#|たって行|ゆけるComment: 0,0:19:56.43,0:20:05.63,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,誰|だ#|れよりも勇|ゆう敢|!か#|んで思|お#|もいやりもあるけれどComment: 0,0:20:05.94,0:20:16.00,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,もしも君|き#|みがこの船|ふ#|ねを下|おりて違|ち#|がう世|せ界|!か#|いに居|いたとしてもComment: 0,0:20:16.06,0:20:24.43,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,最|さ#|い後|!ごにはきっと笑|わ#|らえるよComment: 0,0:19:37.90,0:19:47.33,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,That day, we believed that the our dreamer selves were not wrongComment: 0,0:19:47.37,0:19:55.92,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,And we could go across the rough seasComment: 0,0:19:56.43,0:20:05.63,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,You were braver than anyone else, and considerated too, butComment: 0,0:20:05.94,0:20:16.00,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Even if you leave this ship and end up in another worldComment: 0,0:20:16.06,0:20:24.43,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,I'm sure we'll all be able to smile in the endDialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.90,Main-207+,chapter,0,0,0,,Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.42,0:03:56.38,Main-207+,chapter,0,0,0,,Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.53,0:05:44.57,Main-207+,chapter,0,0,0,,Dialogue: 5,0:00:06.90,0:00:10.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's with you?! Stop this nonsense!Dialogue: 5,0:00:11.69,0:00:14.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why do you need to fight? You two are friends!Dialogue: 5,0:00:14.60,0:00:18.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Give it some time,  and the two of you will cool off, right?Dialogue: 5,0:00:18.57,0:00:22.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And Usopp! He just got fired up  because of how unexpected all this was.Dialogue: 5,0:00:23.01,0:00:25.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's too late to back out now.Dialogue: 5,0:00:26.30,0:00:27.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's not true!Dialogue: 5,0:00:27.57,0:00:31.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can apologize  and talk it over with him!Dialogue: 5,0:00:32.90,0:00:36.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Like I said... it's too late.Dialogue: 5,0:00:36.97,0:00:38.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?Dialogue: 5,0:00:38.72,0:00:44.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usopp isn't stupid enough to risk  his life over a temper tantrum.Dialogue: 5,0:00:44.25,0:00:47.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Besides, if talking it over  would fix this problem,Dialogue: 5,0:00:47.79,0:00:49.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,it wouldn't have gone this far.Dialogue: 5,0:00:51.09,0:00:52.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you get it, leave me alone.Dialogue: 5,0:00:54.44,0:00:55.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy...Dialogue: 5,0:00:55.60,0:01:00.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's just it! The Franky Family  came by this afternoon, right?!Dialogue: 5,0:01:00.66,0:01:03.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? What are you getting at?!Dialogue: 5,0:01:03.24,0:01:07.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you take the opportunity  to beat them to a pulp then?!Dialogue: 5,0:01:07.33,0:01:11.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you had, they wouldn't have attacked Usopp,  and then he wouldn't have felt responsible!Dialogue: 5,0:01:11.90,0:01:16.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay, then instead of going shopping, you should've stayed and kicked their teeth in!Dialogue: 5,0:01:16.84,0:01:19.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's the cook's job to procure essentials!Dialogue: 5,0:01:19.25,0:01:21.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is no time to be fighting!Dialogue: 5,0:01:21.81,0:01:24.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've had enough of that.Dialogue: 5,0:01:25.69,0:01:28.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't argue over what can't be undone.Dialogue: 5,0:01:28.00,0:01:31.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami-san ! But this idiot is...Dialogue: 5,0:01:35.09,0:01:39.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chopper... weren't you... following Usopp?Dialogue: 5,0:01:42.00,0:01:46.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wanted to keep treating his wounds,  but he turned me away.Dialogue: 5,0:01:47.74,0:01:51.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He got a place to stay in town.Dialogue: 5,0:01:51.95,0:01:53.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He said...Dialogue: 5,0:01:54.33,0:01:59.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He said, "You and I are no longer crew members,  so go back to the ship!"Dialogue: 5,0:02:04.21,0:02:07.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's like all the great times we had before today were an illusion.Dialogue: 5,0:02:11.10,0:02:15.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,To top it all off, something may have happened to Robin.Dialogue: 5,0:02:15.55,0:02:18.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I feel like... our crew...Dialogue: 5,0:02:18.03,0:02:20.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,is falling apart.Dialogue: 5,0:02:27.11,0:02:29.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's 10 o'clock, the promised time.Dialogue: 5,0:02:29.30,0:02:31.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usopp will be here.Dialogue: 5,0:02:40.65,0:02:43.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You guys!  Stay on board and don't come down here!Dialogue: 5,0:02:43.76,0:02:45.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Got that?!Dialogue: 5,0:02:51.83,0:02:54.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– There he is!  – Usopp!Dialogue: 5,0:03:17.70,0:03:20.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So you didn't back down, huh?Dialogue: 5,0:03:20.02,0:03:22.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No regrets! No matter how it ends!Dialogue: 5,0:03:22.93,0:03:25.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You asked for this duel!Dialogue: 5,0:03:25.39,0:03:28.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Of course.  Bring it on.Dialogue: 5,0:03:28.64,0:03:30.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll turn the tables on you.Dialogue: 5,0:03:30.73,0:03:34.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've already figured out  how to defeat you.Dialogue: 5,0:03:34.87,0:03:38.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can't we stop them?  Usopp is seriously injured!Dialogue: 5,0:03:38.36,0:03:40.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you can't bear to watch this, go inside.Dialogue: 5,0:03:41.21,0:03:44.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't lump me in with your past enemies  who weren't familiar with your abilities.Dialogue: 5,0:03:44.90,0:03:48.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy, we've known  each other for a long time.Dialogue: 5,0:03:49.40,0:03:52.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know your powers very well.Dialogue: 5,0:05:45.13,0:05:47.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What I say might surprise you, Luffy...Dialogue: 5,0:05:47.49,0:05:50.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I have 8,000 henchmen!Dialogue: 5,0:05:51.09,0:05:54.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you value your life, surrender now!Dialogue: 5,0:05:55.12,0:05:57.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?! 8,000?! That many?!Dialogue: 5,0:05:57.91,0:05:59.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just go inside.Dialogue: 5,0:05:59.54,0:06:02.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I already know you don't have any men!Dialogue: 5,0:06:02.59,0:06:05.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usopp Spell!Dialogue: 5,0:06:05.13,0:06:08.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You've got razor blades  running between your teeth!Dialogue: 5,0:06:09.69,0:06:12.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It hurts just to imagine that!Dialogue: 5,0:06:12.00,0:06:13.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go inside.Dialogue: 5,0:06:13.51,0:06:16.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You've got cactus spines  stuck under your nails!Dialogue: 5,0:06:18.06,0:06:21.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum Pistol!Dialogue: 5,0:06:26.90,0:06:28.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usopp!Dialogue: 5,0:06:29.69,0:06:32.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,See?! He's in bad shape!Dialogue: 5,0:06:33.85,0:06:36.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lethal... Ketchup Star!Dialogue: 5,0:06:37.20,0:06:41.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's that? Feeling sorry  for your enemy? How arrogant!Dialogue: 5,0:06:41.75,0:06:43.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Flash Dial!Dialogue: 5,0:06:48.65,0:06:50.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lethal Egg Star!Dialogue: 5,0:06:52.89,0:06:55.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Star! Star! Star!Dialogue: 5,0:06:57.98,0:06:59.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It stinks! They're rotten!Dialogue: 5,0:07:00.05,0:07:03.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit, you jerk! Fight me for real!Dialogue: 5,0:07:03.10,0:07:06.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Think I'm fooling around?!  I'm deadly serious, Luffy!Dialogue: 5,0:07:06.03,0:07:09.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– What?  – This... is how I fight!Dialogue: 5,0:07:09.69,0:07:12.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Take care your gaping mouth  doesn't get burned!Dialogue: 5,0:07:16.33,0:07:18.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lethal Tabasco Star!Dialogue: 5,0:07:18.75,0:07:21.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It burns!Dialogue: 5,0:07:22.02,0:07:24.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Watch how you thrash about!Dialogue: 5,0:07:24.67,0:07:28.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Or your feet will know my Caltrop Hell!Dialogue: 5,0:07:29.84,0:07:31.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ouch!Dialogue: 5,0:07:32.22,0:07:33.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usopp's controlling the fight!Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.76,0:07:40.02,Title,,0,0,0,,Luffy vs. UsoppDialogue: 1,0:07:34.76,0:07:40.02,Title,,0,0,0,,Luffy vs. UsoppDialogue: 5,0:07:34.64,0:07:36.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Listen, Luffy!Dialogue: 5,0:07:36.60,0:07:40.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rest assured, I'll beat you and take the Merry,Dialogue: 5,0:07:40.02,0:07:42.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,no matter what it takes!Dialogue: 5,0:07:43.27,0:07:45.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lethal Pepper Star!Dialogue: 5,0:07:47.19,0:07:48.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ouch!Dialogue: 5,0:07:56.27,0:07:59.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Didn't I warn you?  I'm only using attacks that work against you!Dialogue: 5,0:08:03.69,0:08:08.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit. It stinks... my mouth is burning...Dialogue: 5,0:08:08.84,0:08:10.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and it hurts!Dialogue: 5,0:08:10.73,0:08:12.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You won't get a chance to hit back!Dialogue: 5,0:08:12.50,0:08:14.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lethal Shuriken Meteor Shower!Dialogue: 5,0:08:58.68,0:08:59.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Smoke?Dialogue: 5,0:09:02.70,0:09:04.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm using a breath dial.Dialogue: 5,0:09:06.41,0:09:09.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I take it the smell was masked by the eggs.Dialogue: 5,0:09:13.78,0:09:16.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The smell of the gas   filling the air around you!Dialogue: 5,0:09:17.46,0:09:18.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gas?Dialogue: 5,0:09:18.41,0:09:19.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He didn't!Dialogue: 5,0:09:20.50,0:09:22.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sorry! Take this!Dialogue: 5,0:09:22.60,0:09:24.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fire Star!Dialogue: 5,0:09:37.01,0:09:38.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's some explosion!Dialogue: 5,0:09:45.85,0:09:47.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Usopp!Dialogue: 5,0:09:58.71,0:10:03.41,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,I am Usopp, leader of the great  pirates who reign over this village!Dialogue: 5,0:10:03.41,0:10:09.79,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,People praise me—and then they praise me more— and refer to me as Captain Usopp!Dialogue: 5,0:10:18.76,0:10:20.34,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,You're a riot!Dialogue: 5,0:10:20.88,0:10:23.34,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Hey, you! Don't insult me!Dialogue: 5,0:10:23.34,0:10:24.56,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,How come?Dialogue: 5,0:10:24.56,0:10:27.27,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,You're one of us now, aren't you?Dialogue: 5,0:10:31.11,0:10:33.74,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,I see an island!Dialogue: 5,0:10:33.74,0:10:37.07,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Incredible!  What kind of island is that?!Dialogue: 5,0:10:37.07,0:10:39.41,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,All right! Go!Dialogue: 5,0:10:39.41,0:10:42.50,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Merry! Full speed ahead!Dialogue: 5,0:10:42.50,0:10:44.95,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Full speed ahead!Dialogue: 5,0:11:15.27,0:11:17.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is too much.Dialogue: 5,0:11:17.03,0:11:20.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Usopp!Dialogue: 5,0:11:37.10,0:11:41.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I figured... an attack like that wouldn't take you out.Dialogue: 5,0:11:41.76,0:11:43.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know you, Luffy.Dialogue: 5,0:11:44.30,0:11:47.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You push your limits in every battle.Dialogue: 5,0:11:49.42,0:11:52.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can read you like a book!Dialogue: 5,0:11:56.44,0:11:57.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lethal...!Dialogue: 5,0:11:57.73,0:12:01.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum Gatling!Dialogue: 5,0:12:01.49,0:12:03.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bursting Cactus Star!Dialogue: 5,0:12:10.41,0:12:12.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ouch!Dialogue: 5,0:12:14.30,0:12:16.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Triple Exploding Stars!Dialogue: 5,0:12:30.56,0:12:33.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum Pistol!Dialogue: 5,0:12:45.99,0:12:51.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum Bazooka!Dialogue: 5,0:12:56.21,0:12:58.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I have a dial here.Dialogue: 5,0:12:58.50,0:13:02.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I absorbed... the impact of your attack!Dialogue: 5,0:13:03.76,0:13:05.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Impact!Dialogue: 5,0:13:10.68,0:13:12.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,An impact dial!Dialogue: 5,0:13:20.07,0:13:22.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How'd you like that?! Dammit!Dialogue: 5,0:13:51.79,0:13:58.06,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,I am Usopp, leader of the great  pirates who reign over this village!Dialogue: 5,0:14:03.29,0:14:05.65,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,To our new ship and crewmate!Dialogue: 5,0:14:05.65,0:14:08.66,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Cheers!Dialogue: 5,0:14:11.01,0:14:12.10,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,This is more like it!Dialogue: 5,0:14:12.10,0:14:14.33,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Looks good!  Let's draw it on the sail too!Dialogue: 5,0:14:14.74,0:14:16.21,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,All right! All done!Dialogue: 5,0:14:16.21,0:14:20.54,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Our pirate ship,  the Going Merry, is finally ready!Dialogue: 5,0:14:21.70,0:14:25.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum...Dialogue: 5,0:14:25.55,0:14:27.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bullet!Dialogue: 5,0:14:37.70,0:14:39.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usopp!Dialogue: 5,0:15:07.60,0:15:09.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fight's over.Dialogue: 5,0:15:23.61,0:15:25.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You idiot!Dialogue: 5,0:15:27.40,0:15:32.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no possible way  you could've defeated me!Dialogue: 5,0:15:58.86,0:16:01.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No... no more...Dialogue: 5,0:16:10.81,0:16:13.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do what you want with the Merry.Dialogue: 5,0:16:17.30,0:16:22.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As for us, we'll get a new ship  and keep sailing forward!Dialogue: 5,0:16:24.21,0:16:26.20,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Hey! Let me sit there too, Luffy!Dialogue: 5,0:16:26.20,0:16:29.17,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,No! This is my special seat!Dialogue: 5,0:16:29.17,0:16:31.10,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Oh? What's that?!Dialogue: 5,0:16:31.10,0:16:32.67,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,What're you making, Usopp?Dialogue: 5,0:16:32.67,0:16:37.09,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Whoa! You guys!  Don't just tromp around Usopp's Factory!Dialogue: 5,0:16:46.80,0:16:50.36,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Someday, I will go to Elbaf!Dialogue: 5,0:16:50.36,0:16:52.99,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,To the village of warriors!Dialogue: 5,0:16:52.99,0:16:56.99,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,All right, Usopp!  Let's make sure we go there!Dialogue: 5,0:16:57.42,0:17:02.47,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Let's get this party started!  It's the gold-hunting eve festival!Dialogue: 5,0:17:12.41,0:17:14.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So long, Usopp.Dialogue: 5,0:17:15.16,0:17:18.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's been fun.Dialogue: 5,0:17:22.85,0:17:24.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't go, Chopper!Dialogue: 5,0:17:26.06,0:17:29.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why shouldn't I?! His injuries were already pretty serious,Dialogue: 5,0:17:29.69,0:17:31.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and now he's in even worse shape!Dialogue: 5,0:17:32.66,0:17:34.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This wasn't a quarrel or a game.Dialogue: 5,0:17:34.41,0:17:39.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's your point?! I'm a doctor!  Let me at least treat him!Dialogue: 5,0:17:43.66,0:17:47.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He lost the duel.  The last thing he wants is our pity.Dialogue: 5,0:17:47.39,0:17:49.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Think how that would make him feel!Dialogue: 5,0:17:52.24,0:17:57.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Carelessly showing the loser kindness  just adds insult to injury.Dialogue: 5,0:17:58.20,0:18:02.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He fought this duel knowing full well  it might turn out this way!Dialogue: 5,0:18:15.30,0:18:16.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's hard!Dialogue: 5,0:18:18.30,0:18:20.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's just the captain's burden, y'know?Dialogue: 5,0:18:21.40,0:18:23.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't doubt yourself.Dialogue: 5,0:18:26.01,0:18:31.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you hesitate, who can we trust?Dialogue: 5,0:18:43.19,0:18:45.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's hand over the ship.Dialogue: 5,0:18:55.57,0:19:01.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We... can't come back. Not ever.Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.68,0:04:26.26,Credits,,0,0,0,,Video Editing    Galaxy 9000Dialogue: 1,0:04:20.68,0:04:26.26,Credits,,0,0,0,,Video Editing    Galaxy 9000Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.97,0:04:31.44,Credits,,0,0,0,,Graphics     DatenshiDialogue: 1,0:04:26.97,0:04:31.44,Credits,,0,0,0,,Graphics     DatenshiDialogue: 0,0:04:31.56,0:04:35.44,Credits,,0,0,0,,Karaoke    KaitouYahikoDialogue: 1,0:04:31.56,0:04:35.44,Credits,,0,0,0,,Karaoke    KaitouYahikoDialogue: 0,0:04:36.94,0:04:41.57,Credits,,0,0,0,,Quality Control    Feeso   JT-421   PepperjackDialogue: 1,0:04:36.94,0:04:41.57,Credits,,0,0,0,,Quality Control    Feeso   JT-421   PepperjackDialogue: 0,0:04:49.50,0:04:56.88,Credits,,0,0,0,,Soundtracking                      HaleeDialogue: 1,0:04:49.50,0:04:56.88,Credits,,0,0,0,,Soundtracking                      HaleeDialogue: 0,0:04:56.88,0:05:00.88,Credits,,0,0,0,,Timing    PhosCityDialogue: 1,0:04:56.88,0:05:00.88,Credits,,0,0,0,,Timing    PhosCityDialogue: 0,0:05:29.54,0:05:33.25,Credits,,0,0,0,,Subtitle Editing     ZenefDialogue: 1,0:05:29.54,0:05:33.25,Credits,,0,0,0,,Subtitle Editing     ZenefDialogue: 0,0:05:33.37,0:05:37.54,Credits,,0,0,0,,Translation     Crunchyroll    GaijinDialogue: 1,0:05:33.37,0:05:37.54,Credits,,0,0,0,,Translation     Crunchyroll    GaijinDialogue: 0,0:03:58.43,0:04:02.49,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,It's all right! It's time to move onDialogue: 0,0:04:02.75,0:04:06.03,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,The sun shines always in our heartsDialogue: 0,0:04:06.17,0:04:09.45,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,Hand in hand, we convey our powerDialogue: 0,0:04:09.54,0:04:13.12,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,And make our wishes come trueDialogue: 0,0:04:20.68,0:04:26.93,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,Combining our strengths, we'll crest these surging seasDialogue: 0,0:04:28.19,0:04:34.73,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,1,,Hurry toward the thrill of danger— Let the adventure begin!Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.40,0:04:41.57,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,Now's the time to set sail; raise the anchorDialogue: 0,0:04:42.37,0:04:49.45,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,Off to the seas of adventure, through rainbow-colored windsDialogue: 0,0:04:49.50,0:04:52.99,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,Our journey's fraught with injuryDialogue: 0,0:04:53.00,0:04:56.71,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,But what we cherish most is right at our sideDialogue: 0,0:04:56.84,0:05:00.79,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,And if you get into a jamDialogue: 0,0:05:00.89,0:05:02.80,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,I'll always be there to protect youDialogue: 0,0:05:03.89,0:05:07.80,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,It's all right! It's time to move onDialogue: 0,0:05:08.10,0:05:11.26,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,The sun shines always in our heartsDialogue: 0,0:05:11.61,0:05:14.77,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,Shoulder to shoulder, we face all coming stormsDialogue: 0,0:05:14.81,0:05:18.64,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,And look to the future for the light of hopeDialogue: 0,0:05:19.11,0:05:22.36,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,If we gather up the pieces of our dreamsDialogue: 0,0:05:22.83,0:05:25.99,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,They'll make a chart leading to tomorrowDialogue: 0,0:05:26.12,0:05:29.16,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,We come together under the same Jolly RogerDialogue: 0,0:05:29.54,0:05:34.89,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,And make our wishes come true; together, we are...Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.71,0:03:59.41,Karaoke-OP5,,0,0,0,fx,m -9 4 l -8 -21 l -6 4 l 4 -5 l -5 5 l 19 7 l -5 8 l 5 18 l -6 9 l -7 33 l -9 9 l -19 18 l -10 7 l -34 6 l -10 5 l -20 -6Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.71,0:03:59.41,Karaoke-OP5,,0,0,0,fx,m -9 4 l -8 -21 l -6 4 l 4 -5 l -5 5 l 19 7 l -5 8 l 5 18 l -6 9 l -7 33 l -9 9 l -19 18 l -10 7 l -34 6 l -10 5 l -20 -6Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.71,0:03:59.41,Karaoke-OP5,,0,0,0,fx,m 1 -5 l 4 -62 l 6 -5 l 30 -25 l 8 -3 l 69 -1 l 8 2 l 30 26 l 6 4 l 3 62 l 1 4 l -24 26 l -2 2 l -62 -1 l -2 -3 l -24 -25Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.71,0:03:59.41,Karaoke-OP5,,0,0,0,fx